  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Powering Angola&#x2019;s Sustainable and Inclusive Rural Transformation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Just Energy Transition Seed Funding track for Angola aims to support rural transformation by building the capacityof public and private institutions to design financing solutions for scaling up Rural Transformation Centers (RTC).These clean energy-powered units provide services to enhance productivity and income for rural cooperatives,MSMEs in agriculture, and women-led groups, reducing inequalities and promoting renewable energy use.Aligned with Angola&#x2019;s Sustainable Development Goals (SDGs)</narrative>
  </description>
